259
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:05,720
No, Liz, don't say that.

260
00:19:06,540 --> 00:19:07,370
It's not.

261
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:14,057
Tell your people to
lay down their weapons.

262
00:19:14,140 --> 00:19:15,080
They do that.

263
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:18,100
And I promise not to
kill you or any of them.

264
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:19,420
We will not.

265
00:19:19,580 --> 00:19:21,000
We do not fear death.

266
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:22,497
We shall fight you until the last.

267
00:19:22,580 --> 00:19:24,345
Do what he says and surrender.

268
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,280
It's over.

269
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:27,080
It's not worth dying for.

270
00:19:27,320 --> 00:19:29,237
I know how you feel. Believe me.

271
00:19:29,320 --> 00:19:30,700
You have to survive!

272
00:19:31,100 --> 00:19:32,580
That's why we're here!

273
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:34,190
It's...

274
00:19:34,273 --> 00:19:35,320
it's our only...

275
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:44,900
We win!

276
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:46,756
We beat the hackers!

277
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:48,980
Been a while.

278
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:50,560
Lightning flash.

279
00:19:58,340 --> 00:20:01,277
Haven't heard anyone use
that handle in a long time?

280
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:04,217
God, it sure does bring
back some good memories.

281
00:20:04,300 --> 00:20:06,297
Revenge is that it?

282
00:20:06,380 --> 00:20:10,677
You want to punish the assault team
for destroying laughing coffin?

283
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:16,477
Are you stupid or something?

284
00:20:16,560 --> 00:20:18,277
Try this on for size.

285
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:20,137
Remember how someone tipped the?

286
00:20:20,220 --> 00:20:23,137
the assault team off about
laughing Goffin's hideout?

287
00:20:23,220 --> 00:20:25,220
Well, that someone was me!

288
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:31,120
Why would you do that?

289
00:20:32,340 --> 00:20:36,752
To prove a point, to make you guys into
the cold-blooded murderers we were,

290
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,607
specifically your boyfriend,

291
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:42,857
always acting high and mighty, but in
the end, he's just a killer like me.

292
00:20:42,940 --> 00:20:45,200
You're insane, that's what you wanted?

293
00:20:45,460 --> 00:20:49,197
To make Kirito, to make
him kill someone in SAO?

294
00:20:49,280 --> 00:20:52,080
Yep, that's exactly what I wanted to do.

295
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:56,417
That day, I found myself a hiding place
and watched the whole thing go down.

296
00:20:56,500 --> 00:21:00,971
When the dumbass in black snapped and
chopped down two of my fellow coffins,

297
00:21:01,340 --> 00:21:04,575
Damn near blew my cover
because I was laughing so hard!

298
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:06,260
You monster!

299
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:08,437
Do you know the guilt you made him suffer?

300
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:10,700
How much he still suffers? Really?

301
00:21:11,080 --> 00:21:15,551
Glad to hear I rubbed off on him, but
I doubt he feels that guilty about it.

302
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:18,340
If he's all torn up like you say, why,

303
00:21:18,500 --> 00:21:22,147
playing VR games would be the
last thing he'd do, but he does.

304
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:24,700
Maybe killing those guys was no biggie.

305
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:26,160
Here's an idea.

306
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:28,740
Your boy's in here too, isn't he?

307
00:21:31,760 --> 00:21:34,220
Yeah, let's ask him how he feels.

308
00:21:46,040 --> 00:21:48,660
No, don't! Please!

309
00:21:52,660 --> 00:21:55,380
It's showtime!

310
00:22:23,620 --> 00:22:25,900
Thank you.

311
00:22:47,040 --> 00:22:49,780
Thank you.

312
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:37,030
I'm stuck.

313
00:23:37,113 --> 00:23:37,943
Next time is The Ghost?
